{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24187","headline":"家酿新熟每尝輙醉妻侄等劝令少饮因成长句以谕之 · 白居易","name":"家酿新熟每尝輙醉妻侄等劝令少饮因成长句以谕之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君应怪我朝朝饮，不说向君君不知。\n身上幸无疼痛处，瓮头正是撇尝时。\n刘妻劝谏夫休醉，王侄分疎叔不痴。\n六十三翁头雪白，假如醒黠欲何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}